                                "sense_id": "33b50ab9-f158-3c30-ae38-94236b5e4aed",
                                "text": "Although the broad macroevolutionary consequences of mass extinctions are well known (as in the dinosaurs-mammals changeover), their long-term effects on the temporal and spatial dynamics of clades and biotas are rarely investigated."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
